"""Immutable scientific-design contracts for Scientist-One vNext.

This module is deliberately provider-independent and uses only the trusted
kernel plus the Python standard library.  It defines the state that must exist
*before* orchestration or prose generation: grounded problem investigation,
novelty and hypothesis registers, a frozen evaluation contract, fair baselines,
complete seed reporting, and fail-closed scientific promotion checks.

The types accept tuples rather than mutable collections, validate bounded
inputs at construction time, and expose content hashes for later binding into
the repository ledger and artifact registry.
"""

